ToolTalk: build for SVR4.

- tt_options.h: an SVR4 block, as Amiga UNIX (Amix) is: TI-RPC over TLI,
  sysinfo(), the SVR4 mount table read with getmntent and locked with
  lockf; single-threaded.
- tt_file_system.C: MNTTYPE_NFS, which not every SVR4 <sys/mntent.h> has.
- tt_xdr_utils.C, mover.C, remover.C: take the existing branches the other
  systems with the same headers use (SunOS 4's xdr casts, <unistd.h>).
- tt_gettext.C: catgets's (char *) cast for SVR4 too.
- mp_rpc_client.C, tt_port.C: struct sigaction's sa_handler is
  void (*)() in an SVR4.0 header; compare and assign through its own type.
- tt_port.C: an SVR4 libc has no vsyslog; format with vsnprintf and
  syslog the result.
- ttsession and ttdbserverd Makefile.am: libstt.a before libtt, which uses
  it, as a static link needs.

